    ZERO_ONE_FOUR_NINE "我的主人？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1177
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_89163b2f:

    # SHYAHTAN "Select two of our veterans for commendation, promote them to your cadre."
    SHYAHTAN "挑选两名我们的老兵进行表彰，将他们晋升到你的干部队伍中。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1178
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_0c41f147:

    # ZERO_ONE_FOUR_NINE "Lord Shyahtan!"
    ZERO_ONE_FOUR_NINE "夏坦大人！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1179
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_8363d396:

    # ZERO_ONE_FOUR_NINE "You bestow a great honor upon me!"
    ZERO_ONE_FOUR_NINE "您赐予我极大的荣誉！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1180
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_4632ede6:

    # SHYAHTAN "Now, lead me to the Hive Lord."
    SHYAHTAN "现在，带我去见蜂巢领主。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1183
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_b185614a:

    # "Zero-one-four-nine nodded and led me toward the great chamber."
    "零一四九点点头，领着我走向大厅。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1184
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_b549384c:

    # "As the fleshy doors parted, the other Terrans bowed their heads in submission as I entered."
    "当肉质的门分开时，其他泰伦人在我进入时低头表示服从。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1188
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_a7dc02de:

    # "There, the Hive Lord gazed out through one of the many great eyes of the blinking ship, staring into the vast sea of stars."
    "在那里，蜂巢领主透过闪烁飞船的众多大眼睛之一向外凝视，注视着广阔的星海。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1189
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_1192c5f3:

    # "He tilted his head toward me as I entered, then returned his gaze to the void."
    "当我进入时，他朝我歪了歪头，然后将目光转回虚空。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1190
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_9bdb9c50:

    # HIVE_LORD "...You have done well, Lord Shyahtan."
    HIVE_LORD "...你做得很好，夏坦大人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1191
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_94da6ee9:

    # SHYAHTAN "I have done as expected of me. Nothing more, nothing less."
    SHYAHTAN "我做了我该做的事。不多也不少。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1192
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_2bcb60ec:

    # HIVE_LORD "Of course."
    HIVE_LORD "当然。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1193
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_caa012f2:

    # HIVE_LORD "You have never failed me before, have you?"
    HIVE_LORD "你以前从未让我失望过，是吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1194
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_493721cc:

    # "There was a long pause between us."
    "我们之间出现了长时间的停顿。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1195
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_e0e94156:

    # SHYAHTAN "...Hive Lord?"
    SHYAHTAN "...蜂巢领主？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1196
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_247840f6:

    # HIVE_LORD "...I am told you are refusing the Great Joining once more this year."
    HIVE_LORD "...我听说你今年再次拒绝参加大融合。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1197
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_928a9605:

    # HIVE_LORD "May I ask why?"
    HIVE_LORD "我可以问为什么吗？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1198
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_caa3608d:

    # SHYAHTAN "The other Terran lords do not understand I am your hammer, great Hive Lord."
    SHYAHTAN "其他泰伦领主不明白我是您的锤子，伟大的蜂巢领主。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1199
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d26154ca:

    # SHYAHTAN "They seek to prove their clans would serve best as your will."
    SHYAHTAN "他们试图证明他们的氏族最能执行您的意志。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1200
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_58800eef:

    # SHYAHTAN "The Great Joining."
    SHYAHTAN "大融合。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1201
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_7955ec9f:

    # SHYAHTAN "Merging all of our minds as one. This will only stoke the fires of their envy."
    SHYAHTAN "将我们所有的思想合而为一。这只会助长他们的嫉妒之火。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1202
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d90ba355:

    # SHYAHTAN "I cannot be your weapon if they undermine my plans."
    SHYAHTAN "如果他们破坏我的计划，我就无法成为您的武器。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1203
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_a9a000a1:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}...Is that so?{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}...是这样吗？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1204
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c18fa599:

    # "Once more, the Hive Lord broke his gaze from the black sea and stared toward me."
    "蜂巢领主再次将目光从黑色海洋上移开，凝视着我。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1205
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_436bd99a:

    # HIVE_LORD "{b}Or could it be because you know your *true* feelings toward me would be laid bare for all to see?{/b}"
    HIVE_LORD "{b}或者是因为你知道你对我的*真实*感受会暴露在所有人面前？{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1206
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d9acc812:

    # SHYAHTAN "..."
    SHYAHTAN "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1207
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_044ee0d7:

    # SHYAHTAN "...Great Hive Lord, my true feelings for you are nothing but-"
    SHYAHTAN "...伟大的蜂巢领主，我对您的真实感受只是-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1208
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c2888de1:

    # "For the faintest moment I paused, the words coming out awkwardly."
    "我在最轻微的一瞬间停顿了一下，话语尴尬地说出。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1209
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_4c1502e6:

    # SHYAHTAN "{b}Loyalty and adoration.{/b}"
    SHYAHTAN "{b}忠诚与崇拜。{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1210
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_7a86e66e:

    # HIVE_LORD "..."
    HIVE_LORD "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1211
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_aa95d732:

    # "The Great Hive Lord tilted his head forward once more."
    "伟大的蜂巢领主再次向前歪了歪头。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1212
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_5a555836:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}Of course, Shyahtan... my greatest general.{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}当然，夏坦...我最伟大的将军。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1213
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c5a16420:

    # HIVE_LORD "Never have I doubted your loyalty."
    HIVE_LORD "我从未怀疑过你的忠诚。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1214
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_b9e35433:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}...Though some believe you are destined to become the new Hive Lord once I return to our great father.{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}...尽管有些人相信一旦我回归我们伟大的父亲，你注定会成为新的蜂巢领主。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1215
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_9cb9c1a8:

    # SHYAHTAN "Then give me these traitors' names and I will see to it my Zarpod feasts upon them."
    SHYAHTAN "那就把这些叛徒的名字给我，我会让我的扎尔波德以他们为食。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1216
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_8ba529fe:

    # HIVE_LORD "...Do you remember the Hive Wars, Shyahtan?"
    HIVE_LORD "...你还记得蜂巢战争吗，夏坦？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1217
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_a3e3e6f7:

    # SHYAHTAN "Those of us who survived could never forget, Hive Lord."
    SHYAHTAN "我们这些幸存者永远不会忘记，蜂巢领主。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1218
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6810b3ed:

    # SHYAHTAN "{i}Do {b}you{/b} remember, Hive Lord, how we fought side by side to exterminate the rogue hive?{/i}"
    SHYAHTAN "{i}{b}您{/b}还记得吗，蜂巢领主，我们如何并肩作战消灭了叛变的蜂巢？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1219
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_375ba8bb:

    # "The Hive Lord didn't answer."
    "蜂巢领主没有回答。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1220
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_f2942cf3:

    # "With a heavy sigh, he turned fully to face me."
    "他沉重地叹了口气，完全转过身来面对我。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1221
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_ba3f361a:

    # HIVE_LORD "I have someone I wish for you to meet."
    HIVE_LORD "我有个人想让你见见。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1222
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_eba7a4c2:

    # HIVE_LORD "A new strain I have helped develop."
    HIVE_LORD "我帮助培育的一个新种。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1223
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_c887cb4f:

    # HIVE_LORD "I hope you will adopt him under your clan's banners for now."
    HIVE_LORD "我希望你暂时将他收编到你的氏族旗下。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1224
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_52a67e0e:

    # "The Hive Lord turned to his personal guard."
    "蜂巢领主转向他的私人护卫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1225
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_cbd3a895:

    # HIVE_LORD "Bring in Eight-Six-One."
    HIVE_LORD "带八六一进来。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1226
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_d350cc90:

    # SHYAHTAN "One of your pet projects?"
    SHYAHTAN "你的宠物项目之一？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1227
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_8c343811:

    # HIVE_LORD "{i}Something like that.{/i}"
    HIVE_LORD "{i}类似的东西。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1231
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6c73278f:

    # "As the fleshy spiral doors opened, a skinny, pale-white Terran approached."
    "当肉质的螺旋门打开时，一个瘦削、苍白的泰伦人走近了。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1234
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_e5272129:

    # EIGHT_SIX_ONE "...G-Greetings, Lord Shyahtan."
    EIGHT_SIX_ONE "...您-您好，夏坦大人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1235
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_5f84324c:

    # MARKUS "WAKE UP!"
    MARKUS "醒醒！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1236
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_47333513:

    # SHYAHTAN "A white strain?"
    SHYAHTAN "白种？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1237
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_2daa1143:

    # SHYAHTAN "What is he-"
    SHYAHTAN "他是什么-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1238
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6b39ce73:

    # "I felt the claws of the Hive Lord rest on my shoulder."
    "我感觉到蜂巢领主的爪子搭在我的肩膀上。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1239
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_6995b2a0:

    # HIVE_LORD "I will watch his performance with great interest, Lord Shyahtan."
    HIVE_LORD "我会非常关注他的表现，夏坦大人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1240
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_5f59a957:

    # "The skinny Terran offered a nervous, curt bow."
    "瘦削的泰伦人紧张地简短鞠了一躬。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1243
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnFromMerlanians_072968fa:

    # EIGHT_SIX_ONE "I am... at your s-service, my lord."
    EIGHT_SIX_ONE "我...听候您的差-差遣，我的主人。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1261
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_28f83f71:

    # MARKUS "You have to... Ahh! WAKE UP!"
    MARKUS "你必须...啊！醒醒！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1263
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_72bdb921:

    # "My eyes peeled open as I stared out at the carnage before me."
    "我的眼睛睁大，凝视着面前的屠杀场面。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1264
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_dec204cd:

    # "The arena was drenched in blood as the Caltrack flailed; bodies and torn limbs littered the ground as people screamed."
    "竞技场被鲜血浸透，卡尔特拉克胡乱挥舞；尸体和撕裂的肢体散落一地，人们尖叫着。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1265
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8a00a866:

    # "Even 希法, usually smug and composed, was barking orders."
    "即使是通常自鸣得意、沉着冷静的希法，也在大声发号施令。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1266
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_6fc3a72a:

    # "Staggering, bleeding, forcing the others to keep moving and fight."
    "蹒跚而行，流着血，强迫其他人继续移动和战斗。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1267
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_9d245642:

    # "Now, with the Caltrack's eyes fixed on her, 希法的 pupils widened; for the first time, I saw fear in her face."
    "现在，卡尔特拉克的眼睛盯着她，希法的瞳孔放大；我第一次在她脸上看到了恐惧。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1268
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8a29f88d:

    # "Any moment, it would come crashing down on her and her exhausted body wouldn't move in time..."
    "随时，它都会向她扑来，而她疲惫的身体无法及时移动..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1269
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_3226ef70:

    # "{i}...But something moved inside me now.{/i}"
    "{i}...但现在我内心有什么东西在动。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1270
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_b89032c8:

    # "I felt my whole body act on its own, rising as a hot surge of energy flooded through me."
    "我感觉我的整个身体自行行动，一股炽热的能量涌遍全身，我站了起来。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1271
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_42819c2d:

    # "{i}What was going on?{/i}"
    "{i}发生了什么？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1273
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_aeaf7911:

    # "Moments ago, I was dying, and now..."
    "片刻之前，我还在垂死挣扎，而现在..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1274
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_c8bf02ac:

    # "I sprang forward. Faster than before."
    "我向前跃去。比以前更快。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1275
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_ad41bb57:

    # "Faster than I'd ever moved."
    "比我以往任何时候移动得都快。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1277
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_f01b3c92:

    # "With a single motion, I swept 希法 from the sand and yanked her clear of the snapping jaws."
    "我单单一动，就把希法从沙地上扫起，将她从咬合的颚中拉开。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1278
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8fa10aa1:

    # "She stared up at me, shock and disbelief warring in her eyes."
    "她抬头看着我，眼中充满了震惊和难以置信。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1279
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_e3fb0534:

    # "I set her down gently and turned back to the Caltrack."
    "我轻轻放下她，转身面对卡尔特拉克。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1280
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_4cfa3603:

    # "It snapped one of its many jaws toward me."
    "它朝我咬合了它众多的颚之一。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1281
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_bb5a2503:

    # "A quick pivot carried me past it."
    "一个快速的转身让我躲过了它。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1283
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_f96435af:

    # "A tentacle latched on and punched through the creature's cheek as I flung myself into the air, crashing down onto one of its heads and driving my claws through its eye."
    "一条触手抓住并穿透了这生物的脸颊，我跃入空中，撞在它的一个头上，用爪子刺穿了它的眼睛。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1285
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8afbe17f:

    # "The beast bellowed, thrashing, a shriek so sharp the crowd clamped hands over ears."
    "这野兽咆哮着，猛烈挣扎，尖叫声如此刺耳，观众们都用手捂住耳朵。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1286
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_30842b18:

    # "{i}I wasn't controlling my limbs.{/i}"
    "{i}我没有控制我的四肢。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1287
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_86951371:

    # "{i}I didn't even know I *could* move like this.{/i}"
    "{i}我甚至不知道我*能*这样移动。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1288
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_3c70e601:

    # "{i}What was happening?{/i}"
    "{i}发生了什么？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1289
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8920d71f:

    # "I slid and rolled down, claws grinding through jelly and bone, carving the socket wide."
    "我滑下并翻滚，爪子磨过胶状物和骨头，将眼窝挖开。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1290
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8279394b:

    # "{i}Were my claws sharper?{/i}"
    "{i}我的爪子更锋利了吗？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1291
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_87a7a085:

    # "{i}My muscles stronger?{/i}"
    "{i}我的肌肉更强壮了吗？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1292
translate zh qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_cc821a2e:

    # "Landing, I dragged my talons in a clean arc, severing the throat of one Caltrack head."
