    # YARRICK @ talk "Lord Zanzibat's home can be found outside the Great Palace."
    YARRICK @ talk "赞兹巴特大人的宅邸就在大皇宫外。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1825
